{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>本年度《2026香港小姐競選》今日（2日）在電視城舉行首輪面試，有份獲邀參加首輪面試的參選佳麗於早上到達電視城，今年港姐競選以「敢·至完美」為主題。多位參賽佳麗雲集，當中不乏打扮性感、身材出眾的高質靚女，但亦有不少以另類個性打扮突圍而出！</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、林迅景、陳釗</p><figure><img alt=\"去年有參選的Gigi今年再接再厲。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138434036696485888103629.jpeg/HZTNYnT8Aval9h8X_KMadENqhPShh3gZDDHCQzYxwkM\"/><figcaption>去年有參選的Gigi今年再接再厲。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gigi指去年被改了有趣花名「Labubu」，今年以紅髮美人魚造型亮相。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138434034062331904371890.jpeg/etqRq40jW66eXecDNWeTEb0_oiXC7eKrRB-kLX4fpC0\"/><figcaption>Gigi指去年被改了有趣花名「Labubu」，今年以紅髮美人魚造型亮相。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Crystal以T恤牛仔褲現身。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430459622199296094752.jpeg/8kTdUWOi6q-U06Xdw2AJ1CCur1X2WqigBALR0z4C0dM\"/><figcaption>Crystal以T恤牛仔褲現身。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"原來係古箏老師。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430457239703552781259.jpeg/s7RFiTB6Zw0vhBBIXx_PhVaJ4c68mWYz5_Xvft31734\"/><figcaption>原來係古箏老師。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"打扮非常悠閒低調。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430454920122368608593.jpeg/0p0LcBgAEylTqip4seMItWNE4uJ780pTshswQIgbMEA\"/><figcaption>打扮非常悠閒低調。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擁有健康膚色的姜文萱以超貼身白色裙示人。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138432730510397440684035.jpeg/v4Z7IhLtzEuhEqLsod593EmNAtiqL6Kqah71rVAe9a0\"/><figcaption>擁有健康膚色的姜文萱以超貼身白色裙示人。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"來自內蒙古的佳麗。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430464055840768649053.jpeg/t-LSf5aGSRsFdS5YoTkCIeOCEeh26pjYD7XTpzW106c\"/><figcaption>來自內蒙古的佳麗。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"特別揀選黃色長裙，原來在家鄉是代表吉祥的顏色，保佑自己能夠入圍。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430461891448832947625.jpeg/rZIVVntOKSWSxf2LYRXAt-d2-Jvd_jOgH2pZ3yVqWd8\"/><figcaption>特別揀選黃色長裙，原來在家鄉是代表吉祥的顏色，保佑自己能夠入圍。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在鄭州讀大學的何小姐以全黑造型來面試。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138434039078981632047231.jpeg/-Z5UtsxoCu_QeHV47lfoivv9SACLp7yTC2JLszFiS7M\"/><figcaption>在鄭州讀大學的何小姐以全黑造型來面試。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"25歲的仲笑蝶（Delia）。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138439438846791680458710.jpeg/6x7p0AwBNRAHiw26xNKnZpCAOxnR6t4aRueDS3zng0s\"/><figcaption>25歲的仲笑蝶（Delia）。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仲笑蝶由父親陪伴下來面試，父親為深圳人，任職心理諮詢師，大讚女兒由細到大都好優秀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138439835430686720943067.jpeg/8vtQ-oUTUeHqchAchQgUwqNOVny7yVVxZIQ_vV6EP70\"/><figcaption>仲笑蝶由父親陪伴下來面試，父親為深圳人，任職心理諮詢師，大讚女兒由細到大都好優秀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"24歲的張婷婷。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138439436506238976486902.jpeg/H6be0Ktb8L2TJgF05yZlEbG7cogEzo25CjkGszA5BrM\"/><figcaption>24歲的張婷婷。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T04:19:27.662905+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}